# 3.Comparison of Results
The vague prompt produces a general interpretation with high creative freedom but unpredictable details. The refined prompt generates a more controlled, visually cohesive image with specific colors, perspective, mood, architectural style, and compositional guidance. In order words, the vague prompt encourages randomness and variation, while the refined prompt improves clarity, consistency, and artistic precision.